==============================================================================
49  GeometryRead.cs: alignment directions computed from coordinates
    (bearing clockwise from north, angleFromEast, quadrantBearing; arc
    start/end bearings; spiral 'turn'). The old note said CCW from east.
50  SheetRead.cs: inspect_file 'limit' is one budget for the whole reply,
    'truncated' list, 'layout' filter (a template returned 138 KB).
51  AlignmentOps.cs (H5): elevation-only PVI change sets ProfilePVI.Elevation
    in place (curve kept, curvesKept); an explicit curve that fails throws
    so the batch rolls back; CurveGiven separates "omitted" from "none".
52  EditContext.BeforeAbort + EditEngine: Civil 3D does not undo PVI changes
    on Transaction.Abort (a failed curve left the PVI removed). The profile
    is snapshotted and restored by difference (first/last PVIs cannot be
    removed) before every abort, failed batch or dry run.
